      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Therefore,\nconsidering the nature of injuries and duration of treatment it can be said that the Rajesh K.N vs Ganesh C.K on 28 August, 2024 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/125336287/\n5"
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "1bcfd5e60ee44203a0f178c5621c1e00_98",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Petitioner may have required at least Two months time for recovering from the injuries sustained by him."
    },
    {
